# The tools in this repo read and write LF. Without this, a Windows checkout gets CRLF
# working files and the next tool run rewrites all of them, so a one-line translation
# change shows up as a whole-file diff.
#
# This governs THIS repo only. The addon repos keep their own conventions - Everything
# Quests is CRLF, EQ Objective Tracker is LF - and build.py detects and preserves each.
* text=auto eol=lf
